# ===== 上传文件目录 =====
# uploads/ 既是种子数据目录, 又是运行时上传目录:
# 只跟踪种子那张头像, 运行时上传的文件不进版本库, 否则 git status 会越用越脏
training-admin-backend/uploads/*
!training-admin-backend/uploads/avatar/
training-admin-backend/uploads/avatar/*
!training-admin-backend/uploads/avatar/photo.jpg

